uring cosmic entities have arrived to suck the planet's nutrients and wreak havoc. But they didn't count on the dormant fury... of two beans! Stan, the sarcastic and full of attitude blue bean, and Shan, the silly but courageous green bean, the two bean brothers join forces to face the galactic creatures and save the planet in a journey that goes from the streets to the ends of the void!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616940/extras/gif2.gif?t=1745573018\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The game has simple 2D platform shooter gameplay. The player can move from side to side, shooting upwards at enemies that descend across the screen. Shoot at enemies, collect new weapons, shoot more, dodge projectiles, shoot some more and use unique abilities \u2014 but don't forget to shoot! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Arcade Shooter Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> Face waves of enemies while dodging projectiles, defeating bosses, collecting new weapons and spitting out lots of ammo!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Linear Progression Campaign</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> The player advances through themed stages, each with unique environments.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fall Mechanics </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>At a certain point in each stage, the ground breaks and the player falls to the next, in a striking visual transition.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["DeadQueen Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c